#: data/maps/FortreeCity_House3/scripts.inc:12
msgctxt "FortreeCity_House3_Text_MetStevenHadAmazingPokemon"
msgid ""
"While speaking about POKéDEXES,\n"
"I remembered something.\p"
"I met this TRAINER, STEVEN, when\n"
"I was searching for rare stones.\p"
"Hoo, boy, he had some amazing POKéMON\n"
"with him.\p"
"They weren't just rare, they were\n"
"trained to terrifying extremes!\p"
"He might even be stronger than the\n"
"GYM LEADER in this town…$"
msgstr ""
"说到宝可梦图鉴，我想起了一件事。\p"
"我在寻找稀有石头的时候，\n"
"遇到过一位叫大吾的训练家。\p"
"哎呀呀，他带着的宝可梦真是了不得。\p"
"不光稀有，还被锻炼到了可怕的地步！\p"
"说不定他比这个镇上的\n"
"道馆馆主还要强呢……$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_House3/scripts.inc:24
msgctxt "FortreeCity_House3_Text_OhYouHavePokedex"
msgid ""
"What's that thing you have there?\p"
"… … … … … …\p"
"Oh, it's called a POKéDEX?\n"
"It's really awesome!$"
msgstr ""
"你拿着的那个是什么？\p"
"…… …… …… …… …… ……\p"
"哦，那叫宝可梦图鉴？真是太厉害了！$"
